---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {href} from '../../lib/data';
import FdeRoadmap from '../../components/FdeRoadmap.astro';
import graph from '../../generated/fde.json';
import packages from '../../generated/workflows.json';
interface Skill {id:string;title:string;level:string;prerequisite_ids:string[];guide_path:string;source_refs:string[];checked_at:string;evidence_level:string}
const skills=graph.skills as Skill[];
const titles=new Map(skills.map(s=>[s.id,s.title]));
const bundles=packages.filter(w=>'domain' in w&&w.domain==='fde').toSorted((a,b)=>b.version.localeCompare(a.version,undefined,{numeric:true}));
const levels:Record<string,string>={foundation:'基礎',intermediate:'整合',advanced:'進階'};
---
<Layout title="AI 應用工程師 / FDE">
 <section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FORWARD DEPLOYED ENGINEERING</p><h1>AI 應用工程師的交付路線</h1><a class="text-link" href={href('guides/fde/setup')}>本機與選配帳號設定 ↗</a><p>從企業問題、資料與 API，到 AI 解決方案、可靠執行與交接。不限 Android，依團隊需要選 Python 或 Java Spring Boot。</p><a class="button" href={href('guides/fde/getting-started/')}>開始學習</a> <a class="text-link" href={href('downloads/fde/roadmap.md')} download>下載學習路線 MD</a><p>查核：{graph.checked_at} · 第一方調研與本平台建議 · 尚非企業實測</p></section>
 <section class="principles"><h2>依能力前進，參考十二週</h2><p>已有經驗可跳過基礎。訓練是選修；先建立可驗收、可恢復、可交接的系統。</p><FdeRoadmap/><a class="text-link" href={href('guides/fde/roadmap/')}>技能依賴與 Mermaid 流程原碼 ↗</a></section>
 <section class="updates"><div class="section-title"><h2>能力與技能樹</h2><a href={href('fde/updates/')}>查看最新變化 ↗</a></div><div class="workflow-grid">{skills.map(s=><article class="download-card workflow-card fde-skill" id={s.id}><span class="tag">{levels[s.level]||s.level}</span><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>前置：{s.prerequisite_ids.length?s.prerequisite_ids.map(id=>titles.get(id)||id).join('、'):'起點'}</p><p>查核 {s.checked_at} · 第一方資料與平台建議</p><a class="text-link" href={href('guides/'+s.guide_path.replace(/\.md$/,''))}>{s.id==='rag'?'閱讀 RAG 指南':'閱讀 '+s.title+'指南'}</a><a class="text-link" href={href('downloads/'+s.guide_path)} download>下載 MD ↓</a><details class="bundle-files"><summary>第一方依據</summary>{s.source_refs.map(url=><a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{url}</a>)}</details></article>)}</div></section>
 <section class="updates"><h2>技能下載與版本</h2><p>兩個薄技能：企業解決方案與知識更新審閱。詳細契約依任務讀取，公開文件核准不代表公司採納。</p>{bundles.map(w=><article class="download-card workflow-card"><span class="tag">{w.adoption_state==='deprecated'?'已停用 / 請用修正版 0.3.0':'候選 / 尚無企業實測'}</span><h3>{w.id} · {w.version}</h3><p>自有 MIT adapter，upstream 另行安裝。包含安裝／移除與 references；不含憑證、資料庫或 model weights。</p>{w.deprecation_reason&&<p>{w.deprecation_reason}</p>}<a class="button" href={href('downloads/'+w.download_path)} download>下載 FDE 技能 ZIP {w.version}</a><p class="checksum">SHA-256 <code>{w.sha256}</code></p><details class="bundle-files"><summary>包內檔案</summary><ul>{w.included_files.map(f=><li>{f}</li>)}</ul></details></article>)}</section>
 <section class="principles"><h2>先本機，最後配置雲端</h2><p>先驗證授權 RAG、任務中斷恢復與資料品質，再整合 API／DB／排程。Python RAG、持久任務與資料準備已提供本機教學範例；Java API 與 wizard 依後續階段加入。真實本機模型、GPU 訓練與雲端部署需另外驗收。</p><a class="text-link" href={href('guides/fde/sources/')}>來源與雙週更新方法 ↗</a></section>
</Layout>
